;s 5 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 56% of normal in January to February and 57% in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 51% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 23321 had its driest year in 1965 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
